WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
The wedding banquet, wine, sugar and tea are all included.

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:04,640
Our lives will only get better and better in the future

3
00:00:12,130 --> 00:00:13,570
You take this rice and meat back with you

4
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:15,810
Eat more with Shen Zi Xiaoshan to keep your body healthy

5
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:17,770
Brother Qin, this is too much

6
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:18,930
You run outside every day

7
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:19,850
Should make up for it more

8
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:22,050
And I haven’t finished eating the rice you gave me last time.

9
00:00:23,130 --> 00:00:25,810
Spending money on your own family is called waste, let alone that.

10
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:27,010
I raised you all white and fat.

11
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:28,170
When I take it out, my face will shine

12
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:29,850
Who wants to be fat for nothing?

13
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:38,810
My Xiaoxi is beautiful no matter what

14
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:54,140
I, Jinshan, have missed me these past few days, and I have also missed you.

15
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:56,830
If you have a slippery tongue, get out of the way

16
00:00:56,830 --> 00:00:57,990
My mother is still waiting for me at home
